{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >On yet another dark and stormy night, you and your friend, a pair of professional pallbearers, are entrusted with the sacred mission of safely delivering a \u201cvery important client\u201d to their final destination. Call up that one trustworthy friend of yours, and embark on the most absurd funeral journey ever!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON'T FORGET TO WISHLIST THE HILLTOP FUNERAL NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Job Offer:</strong> <br>Last Stop Cemetery is currently hiring a part-time worker to join our team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position: Pallbearer\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Wait, what does...a pallbearer do...?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Job Description</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carrying coffins\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>&quot;Oh.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Applicants may come for an interview at the cemetery after sunset\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>&quot;Hmm\u2026 I guess it couldn't hurt?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2014The Part-Timer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/9da50947ccf50a2b39c98d411ad36484.poster.avif?t=1758252117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/9da50947ccf50a2b39c98d411ad36484.webm?t=1758252117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Co-op &amp; Left Brain-Right Brain Battle Adventure of a Funeral Journey:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friend will take on the task of a hilarious coffin-carrying duo, overcoming traps and challenges amidst both\u00a0Chemistry and bickering on an adventure-filled funeral road full of \u201csurprises.\u201d Your goal is to complete one laugh-out-loud funeral after another and finally deliver the \u201cclient\u201d smoothly to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deceptively simple controls require ultimate coordination\u2014will you glide like you\u2019re doing the moonwalk or eat dirt face-first? It all depends on your choices! Keeping the body from falling out is your one and only mission!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>The game supports both local and online co-op play!</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/de05dcabf5876cb0fc0088286d1f8356.poster.avif?t=1758252117\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/de05dcabf5876cb0fc0088286d1f8356.webm?t=1758252117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/de05dcabf5876cb0fc0088286d1f8356.mp4?t=1758252117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hilarious Physics System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience physics so wild that not even Newton\u2019s coffin lid can hold them down! Every tug, every stumble can trigger a disaster scene straight out of a comedy clip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heads up: the corpse will also try to \u201cescape\u201d the coffin in all kinds of ridiculous ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/6eabbfc08f55643749884e4d08856c19.poster.avif?t=1758252117\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/6eabbfc08f55643749884e4d08856c19.webm?t=1758252117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/6eabbfc08f55643749884e4d08856c19.mp4?t=1758252117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Perilous Funeral Journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You thought it was just about walking? Think again! We\u2019ve prepared a rich \u201csurprise gift pack\u201d for our \u201cfuneral team\u201d:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Obstacles: Stairs, narrow bridges, and muddy sections are just the warm-up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/001e727e807bef9273f45568b5531a37.poster.avif?t=1758252117\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/001e727e807bef9273f45568b5531a37.webm?t=1758252117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/001e727e807bef9273f45568b5531a37.mp4?t=1758252117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist it now! And join our discord:\u00a0</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553350?t=1758252117","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/fcec54423cdf98eaf3bb0bda3cd88d4eb133fc8b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758252117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/23db72fd5a6767313bb4952f092e6f4498a84194/capsul