am.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position: Pallbearer\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Wait, what does...a pallbearer do...?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Job Description</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carrying coffins\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>&quot;Oh.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Applicants may come for an interview at the cemetery after sunset\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>&quot;Hmm\u2026 I guess it couldn't hurt?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2014The Part-Timer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/9da50947ccf50a2b39c98d411ad36484.poster.avif?t=1758252117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/9da50947ccf50a2b39c98d411ad36484.webm?t=1758252117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Co-op &amp; Left Brain-Right Brain Battle Adventure of a Funeral Journey:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friend will take on the task of a hilarious coffin-carrying duo, overcoming traps and challenges amidst both\u00a0Chemistry and bickering on an adventure-filled funeral road full of \u201csurprises.\u201d Your goal is to complete one laugh-out-loud funeral after another and finally deliver the \u201cclient\u201d smoothly to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deceptively simple controls require ultimate coordination\u2014will you glide like you\u2019re doing the moonwalk or eat dirt face-first? It all depends on your choices! Keeping the body from falling out is your one and only mission!!<